WEBVTT

02:08:34.032 --> 02:08:37.249
Does he know how much grief he's causing everyone?

02:08:39.707 --> 02:08:41.687
Isn't what you did unjust, Annie?

02:08:41.742 --> 02:08:43.893
How much would he have craved this child?

02:08:43.918 --> 02:08:45.536
Be it unjust or cruel,

02:08:46.307 --> 02:08:47.882
I can't abandon him.

02:08:48.398 --> 02:08:50.037
For him I am just a tool

02:08:50.531 --> 02:08:53.977
But ...
I am a mother.

02:08:54.556 --> 02:08:56.514
Now, we will have our own children

02:08:56.711 --> 02:08:57.795
So?

02:08:58.289 --> 02:09:01.656
He was the first life to stir within me.
How can be not be my son?

02:09:04.519 --> 02:09:05.944
The mistake is mine,

02:09:07.078 --> 02:09:09.783
I did not need this second life.

02:09:11.025 --> 02:09:12.493
The price I paid for this?

02:09:12.645 --> 02:09:15.777
Das!
Yes Annie, Das is also a husband.

02:09:17.567 --> 02:09:23.942
A husband who had the misfortune
of witnessing his own wife bear another man's child.

02:09:25.183 --> 02:09:27.376
Self-esteem was sacrificed that day.

02:09:28.148 --> 02:09:29.872
My ears from the mockery.

02:09:30.815 --> 02:09:34.436
To the locals, do you know who Chandra Das now is?

02:09:35.075 --> 02:09:39.371
A man who rented out his wife to another man.
A 'gentleman' who lives off that money.

02:09:41.475 --> 02:09:47.764
A reminder of my misfortune,
I won't be able to stand this burden being with us for the rest of our lives.

02:09:50.704 --> 02:09:53.457
Then,
you can abandon me Das.

02:09:58.000 --> 02:09:59.831
I will carry this burden alone.

02:10:00.688 --> 02:10:04.012
After one more year,
you will be able to enter the field again Das.

02:10:05.061 --> 02:10:06.870
Become a proud star for the fans.

02:10:07.984 --> 02:10:11.286
But Annie and her son will not come there
as a testament to your humilation.

02:10:49.207 --> 02:10:50.931
Remain calm Rajeev.

02:10:51.337 --> 02:10:52.933
We can find a way.

02:10:53.403 --> 02:10:55.084
Yes! Why fear needlessly

02:10:55.343 --> 02:10:57.729
Just now I brought you on bail so easily.

02:10:58.287 --> 02:11:00.502
And that too considering all the charges.

02:11:00.847 --> 02:11:02.869
Intimidation, ???

02:11:03.300 --> 02:11:06.351
If it was another advocate,
there would've been an order to put you in remand.

02:11:06.799 --> 02:11:08.118
That would've been better.

02:11:08.676 --> 02:11:12.430
Life imprisonment with no chance to leave early.

02:11:22.148 --> 02:11:24.896
Advocate, will we get the child back?

02:11:25.114 --> 02:11:28.096
We must get it.
The case might be complicated.

02:11:28.783 --> 02:11:30.486
We can argue with two points.

02:11:31.172 --> 02:11:34.943
Firstly, breach of contract.
Acting contrary to the agreement.

02:11:35.395 --> 02:11:37.226
Then, cheating.
Betrayal of trust.

02:11:38.073 --> 02:11:40.927
Isn't there a legal way of claiming the child?

02:11:41.039 --> 02:11:44.661
Isn't that the contract?
This contract's strength is our strength.

02:11:45.578 --> 02:11:49.158
We wrote this then only on my insistence!
And if we hadn't?

02:11:50.625 --> 02:11:56.700
This advocate Govindan is only called ??? by ???.
No one with brains will do that. What do you say?

02:11:56.918 --> 02:11:58.877
That we can say after the case is over.

02:11:59.243 --> 02:12:02.089
You too must come to the court.
As a witness.

02:12:03.416 --> 02:12:12.585
It is based on this ??? contract, that the
second party is now keeping the child in their custody.

02:12:12.653 --> 02:12:17.193
That is a breach of contract under Section 406 of the Indian Contract Act.

02:12:17.817 --> 02:12:19.925
Two lakh rupees in cash was received.

02:12:20.228 --> 02:12:25.664
Rejecting all terms agreed to verbally and in writing by the other party, is a betrayal of trust.

02:12:25.945 --> 02:12:29.034
Cheating.
Section 420 of the IPC.

02:12:29.268 --> 02:12:37.008
I humbly request the court to take action
to return the child to my honest client. ???

02:12:37.247 --> 02:12:38.416
That's all Your Honour.

02:12:43.635 --> 02:12:47.855
Your Honour.
My client does not reject the contract terms mentioned earlier.

02:12:48.642 --> 02:12:56.957
But for artifical insemination, and for the actions
taken by the first party, there is no legal standing in India.

02:12:57.512 --> 02:13:02.265
And so, ???
this contract is invalid.

02:13:02.739 --> 02:13:04.037
It is an illegal contract.

02:13:04.198 --> 02:13:05.645
My client is married.

02:13:06.331 --> 02:13:07.948
Her husband is still alive.

02:13:08.186 --> 02:13:13.526
So, legally possession of this child
is assigned to my client's husband.

02:13:13.743 --> 02:13:15.296
Marriage certificate is produced.

02:13:15.727 --> 02:13:18.304
So I request Your Honour, to set aside the contract.

02:13:18.543 --> 02:13:20.289
That's all Your Honour.
Thank you.

02:13:30.058 --> 02:13:32.636
This agreement is against the Indian Contract Act.

02:13:32.768 --> 02:13:34.747
So the petition is rejected.

02:13:38.672 --> 02:13:41.015
Your Honour,
as a special case?

02:13:42.506 --> 02:13:45.702
Sir, everything stated in the petition is true.

02:13:46.473 --> 02:13:47.579
I don't know the law.

02:13:47.796 --> 02:13:50.268
But he is my son!
You must give him to me!

02:13:50.474 --> 02:13:54.118
What you are saying might be true.
But legally there is no possibility.

02:13:54.677 --> 02:13:56.188
You can appeal anywhere.

02:13:56.469 --> 02:13:59.515
But no court in India will consider this.

02:14:12.617 --> 02:14:13.978
What are you thinking?

02:14:15.625 --> 02:14:17.413
I was thinking about Rajeev.

02:14:17.950 --> 02:14:21.679
When the court said the contract is illegal,
he became very despondent.

02:14:22.686 --> 02:14:23.962
God is with me.

02:14:24.307 --> 02:14:26.732
Then, God is unjust.

02:14:26.961 --> 02:14:29.261
You're still unable to understand me, Das.

02:14:29.671 --> 02:14:34.339
I know.
But, I can understand everyone.

02:14:34.470 --> 02:14:38.371
You have hatred for my son.
That's why you're speaking for him.

02:14:38.566 --> 02:14:39.970
It's not hatred, Annie.

02:14:43.985 --> 02:14:47.650
I had desired to share my life with you.

02:14:48.316 --> 02:14:50.168
Didn't you just now say <i>my</i> son?

02:14:51.268 --> 02:14:54.080
He will always be your son.
He can never be ours.

02:15:00.098 --> 02:15:03.059
He will always only be your son.

02:15:04.087 --> 02:15:06.301
And I will be alone.

02:15:07.500 --> 02:15:09.160
I can't stand that Annie.

02:15:09.953 --> 02:15:15.602
Do not think like that.
You will always be with me Das. You must.

02:15:16.206 --> 02:15:21.502
Isn't that why I did something that
no other woman would do?

02:15:22.730 --> 02:15:26.225
I didn't know that I would come to love this child.

02:15:27.445 --> 02:15:31.024
When he grows up, will he not go in search of his father?

02:15:31.242 --> 02:15:36.080
No, my son will not leave me.

02:15:45.948 --> 02:15:49.059
Else, let him leave if he wants to.

02:15:49.489 --> 02:15:52.514
Until then, he is our son.

02:15:53.301 --> 02:15:58.353
My Das will be his father.
Will you not love him like a child, Das?

02:15:58.975 --> 02:16:02.492
Don't cry Annie.
Don't cry.

02:16:19.290 --> 02:16:21.803
You've gone back to your old ways?

02:16:22.766 --> 02:16:24.618
Yes.

02:16:26.389 --> 02:16:30.480
The restart went beautifully.
No issues.

02:16:33.657 --> 02:16:35.851
There's one thing that will make you happy.

02:16:36.131 --> 02:16:40.863
Don't you say that these assets will all get taken by others.

02:16:41.486 --> 02:16:43.316
Don't need to fear that now.

02:16:44.643 --> 02:16:46.239
My son.

02:16:47.010 --> 02:16:48.499
This will all be his.

02:16:48.995 --> 02:16:51.145
Come, go to bed.
- No.

02:16:52.407 --> 02:16:54.558
I was resting all this while.

02:16:57.800 --> 02:17:00.932
Enjoyed a dream while sleeping.

02:17:03.426 --> 02:17:04.872
Eight to ten months.

02:17:06.220 --> 02:17:07.688
That's gone.

02:17:09.036 --> 02:17:12.296
In a way, it was good
that it happend like this.

02:17:13.324 --> 02:17:16.904
Because ...
he won't be like me.

02:17:17.846 --> 02:17:19.612
He'll get everything I didn't.

02:17:20.193 --> 02:17:21.213
A good mother.

02:17:21.893 --> 02:17:27.649
He'll growing listening to lullabies
and being loved. ???

02:17:28.606 --> 02:17:31.717
Couldn't we watch this from afar, Uncle?

02:17:32.275 --> 02:17:35.300
Son, why are you getting sad like this?

02:17:35.283 --> 02:17:37.561
No, I am not gettng sad.

02:17:39.507 --> 02:17:42.597
Oh, the tears right?

02:17:43.262 --> 02:17:46.671
That must be tears of joy.

02:17:50.131 --> 02:17:50.976
Yes.

02:17:51.949 --> 02:17:53.758
Joy.

02:18:09.250 --> 02:18:10.995
Mother!

02:18:11.239 --> 02:18:14.158
Annie, don't fear.

02:18:14.823 --> 02:18:17.619
I have not come to steal him away.

02:18:23.561 --> 02:18:27.227
But to ask once more in the name of humanity.

02:18:27.956 --> 02:18:30.363
I have only him as a relative.

02:18:32.753 --> 02:18:36.738
I have not loved anyone or been loved.

02:18:37.793 --> 02:18:41.704
Life was a flow until now.
Flowing somewhere.

02:18:42.583 --> 02:18:46.142
Since my son's birth,
a lot of new things,...

02:18:46.381 --> 02:18:50.515
... many plans were made
and a new life were just beginning.

02:18:51.628 --> 02:18:55.293
All the love I saved until now,
I gave to him.

02:18:55.762 --> 02:18:59.193
When all that is being lost,
I can't bear it.

02:19:00.135 --> 02:19:04.120
So, can't you take everything that's mine
and give me just my son?

02:19:04.231 --> 02:19:05.971
No, I won't give him.

02:19:07.583 --> 02:19:08.756
Okay, leave it.

02:19:10.147 --> 02:19:11.125
Chandradas ...

02:19:12.387 --> 02:19:17.311
I didn't want to spend the rest of my life wondering...
'What if I had asked just one more time?'

02:19:17.827 --> 02:19:20.212
That's why I came here today, like a beggar.

02:19:21.304 --> 02:19:23.391
I have a request for you Chandradas.

02:19:24.994 --> 02:19:26.867
Do not hate my son.

02:19:28.039 --> 02:19:29.549
When he grows up ...

02:19:30.663 --> 02:19:35.224
.. don't tell him the story of this stupid father.

02:19:35.546 --> 02:19:38.230
When he grows up, he'll come looking for you.
It's certain.

02:19:40.089 --> 02:19:41.045
Thank you.

02:19:43.388 --> 02:19:45.368
Will I be alive then?

02:19:53.049 --> 02:19:55.606
May I hold him for a moment?

02:19:57.804 --> 02:19:59.080
Give it to him, dear.

02:20:12.598 --> 02:20:15.558
All my assets will be for him.

02:20:17.078 --> 02:20:20.061
Don't insult me as a money-minded fool.???

02:20:21.579 --> 02:20:25.699
I felt very proud to be called a father.

02:20:27.363 --> 02:20:30.325
Not once did you call me like that.

02:20:40.455 --> 02:20:41.971
Goodbye.

02:20:48.887 --> 02:20:53.234
If tomorrow he asks us,
<i>"Didn't you destroy my father?" ...</i>

02:20:53.751 --> 02:20:55.752
what will you reply Annie?

02:21:10.601 --> 02:21:13.821
Did the doctor, midwives and nurses leave?

02:21:13.919 --> 02:21:15.963
They left in the morning itself.

02:21:18.036 --> 02:21:19.504
Why didn't you leave Maggie?

02:21:20.489 --> 02:21:22.277
Didn't you get all your wages?

02:21:22.601 --> 02:21:25.221
Yes.
I wanted to leave after coming and seeing you.

02:21:28.867 --> 02:21:32.212
I know you are very sad, sir.

02:21:32.408 --> 02:21:34.900
No.
Who said?

02:21:36.498 --> 02:21:40.397
After a marriage, more children can be born.

02:21:42.617 --> 02:21:43.787
I don't want that.

02:21:45.881 --> 02:21:50.144
I had the crazy thought of having a son.
That's over.

02:21:52.273 --> 02:21:55.661
Are there any other crazy thoughts?

02:22:01.481 --> 02:22:03.355
Give me a glass.

02:22:04.916 --> 02:22:09.136
Now in this home, alcohol and smoking are allowed, right?

02:22:10.182 --> 02:22:14.337
Haven't you heard the tale of the mouse-maid who turned back into a mouse?

02:22:47.745 --> 02:22:49.512
What is it Chandradas?

02:22:56.825 --> 02:22:57.924
Your child.

02:23:01.847 --> 02:23:03.037
Annie?

02:23:03.254 --> 02:23:07.005
No one could compete with the love you showed him.

02:23:12.936 --> 02:23:15.108
Did Annie agree?

02:23:15.237 --> 02:23:16.427
She had to agree.

02:23:22.764 --> 02:23:23.612
Take him.

02:23:38.819 --> 02:23:39.988
Maggie.
- Sir

02:23:42.212 --> 02:23:45.067
This is not a dream, right?
- No

02:23:45.764 --> 02:23:52.395
If I didn't do this, then I would never have peace
in the new life I owe to your generosity.

02:23:52.676 --> 02:23:54.122
Thank you.
Thank you.

02:23:54.925 --> 02:23:56.350
Annie is in the car.

02:23:57.058 --> 02:24:00.041
We are leaving this place.

02:24:00.919 --> 02:24:04.051
She needs a change.
Otherwise...

02:24:28.224 --> 02:24:30.566
What is this Annie?
Hadn't you agreed to everything?

02:24:30.614 --> 02:24:33.724
I can't. I can't leave him.
Leave me.

02:24:33.920 --> 02:24:38.695
Give me my son back. I need him.
I need my son.

02:24:38.799 --> 02:24:39.499
Annie!

02:24:40.826 --> 02:24:42.529
So you don't want me?

02:24:45.029 --> 02:24:47.628
Tell me.
You have to decide between the two.

02:24:47.866 --> 02:24:51.019
If you have even a little love for me,
then you must come with me now.

02:24:51.664 --> 02:24:54.859
Otherwise, don't expect Chandradas later.

02:26:15.332 --> 02:26:16.523
Take him.

02:26:17.145 --> 02:26:18.251
Annie's son.

02:26:32.213 --> 02:26:33.233
You may go.

02:26:49.289 --> 02:26:50.415
Chandradas.

02:26:51.721 --> 02:26:53.039
You are a great man.

02:26:54.238 --> 02:26:56.581
Else you wouldn't have shown me this much pity.

02:26:57.816 --> 02:27:01.225
Don't trap her in a competition.

02:27:01.930 --> 02:27:03.633
Maybe you would lose.

02:27:04.661 --> 02:27:06.001
That must not happen.

02:27:12.508 --> 02:27:13.336
Enter.

02:27:20.737 --> 02:27:23.464
We might not come back.

02:27:24.124 --> 02:27:26.360
Be happy wherever you are.

02:27:27.364 --> 02:27:31.008
I have a final request.
Don't refuse it.

02:27:31.818 --> 02:27:35.739
Amidst all the changes, I developed some unnecessary beliefs.

02:27:37.359 --> 02:27:43.690
If I die, please allow him to do ??? and whatever may be the final rites.

02:27:44.441 --> 02:27:45.504
That is the tradition.

02:27:46.824 --> 02:27:51.577
It is the son who should light the father's funeral pyre.
As you would know Chandradas.

02:27:52.754 --> 02:27:55.971
At least in the afterlife, let me find peace.

02:28:09.046 --> 02:28:10.194
Annie.

02:28:12.135 --> 02:28:14.307
I have only happiness.

02:28:15.121 --> 02:28:17.251
My son will grow well.

02:28:18.641 --> 02:28:22.434
I am beginning to learn a lot through you.

02:28:23.460 --> 02:28:24.608
You may leave.

02:28:55.838 --> 02:28:58.650
Are all mothers like Annie?

02:28:59.694 --> 02:29:00.394
Yes my child.

02:29:01.678 --> 02:29:03.210
I know what's in your mind.

02:29:04.683 --> 02:29:06.577
Were you not thinking about your mother?

02:29:07.262 --> 02:29:08.517
I have also heard.

02:29:09.395 --> 02:29:12.378
That woman will never have been happy.

02:29:13.000 --> 02:29:15.883
Her whole life she would've been in pain.

02:29:26.948 --> 02:29:30.997
In the same way that Annie loves her son...

02:29:32.877 --> 02:29:35.007
can you love me Maggie?

